+/**
+ * Owns the signed-in session. The [MutableStateFlow] is the only source of truth, and every
+ * transition goes through a compare-and-set, so exactly one caller ever observes a given component
+ * leaving the flow and is therefore the one that tears it down. That makes teardown exactly-once
+ * even when two logins race.
+ */
 @Inject
 @SingleIn(AppScope::class)
 @ContributesBinding(AppScope::class)
